{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_01_end",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_01",
  "title": "外勤記錄",
  "storyCode": "OD-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f9d3ea6d1e16dc0ce9b693a7a5acbbfd3e65fd0a668275cece448b56ac6d55c4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後一隻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他人呢！有人受傷嗎?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這裡也沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通訊設備呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是地洞？......奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些怪物，看起來像是沙地獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長成這樣的沙地獸？兩米多長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......老夫在荒地裡過了大半輩子，可沒有見過會挖洞的沙地獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這些動物，身上都有源石結晶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會不會是源石污染導致的生物變異？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這附近沒有移動城市，沒有工廠，沒有礦山，怎麼會有源石污染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有沒有可能是天災導致的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你太小看大自然了。野生動物遠比我們熟悉天災，也比我們更清楚如何回避源石污染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天災能摧毀一座城市，但野生動物幾乎不會受到影響——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——這片大地的淘汰是無情的，一個物種如果做不到以自己的方式與源石共生，就不可能延續到現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此......我能想像。就像最常見的源石蟲那樣，體表外殼吸收了所有源石成分，內部的軟體部分卻完全純淨沒有污染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說回來，PRTS的記錄裡有過類似案例嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，就算是哥倫比亞鑄鐵城的那次洩漏事故也沒有出現這種情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沙地獸是很膽小的生物，源石變異也不該如此劇烈地改變這一點。除非被法術影響，否則它們不會展現出攻擊性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保持警戒，不要鬆懈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......法術？術師？我只希望這趟遠路不要再節外生枝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用想太多，繼續按照原定安排前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......羅德島的緊急求援信號？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是其他羅德島的外勤隊伍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝天謝......終於有人回應了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......救......救命......請求支援......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是羅德島外勤小隊，收到請回復。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是......長泉......瞭望塔33......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......暴徒......正在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他們進來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冷靜一點！幹員，出什麼事了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信號很差，斷斷續續的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......救命......救......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞭望塔33是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽起來像是羅德島的安全屋代號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安全屋？任務報告上沒說過這附近還有安全屋啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島確實會在一些偏僻的區域安插隱蔽安全屋，用於特殊外勤任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我們不知道瞭望塔33在哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長泉......長泉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個名字，老夫有點印象，讓我看看地圖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該是這裡，沿著喇叭山向東走20公里就能看到另一個峽谷，峽谷附近確實有過一個小鎮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當年小鎮裡有一口井，是這附近少數可靠的水源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以就叫作長泉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以接下來要怎麼辦，改變計劃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也可以連夜趕往費坤，嘗試聯絡辦事處，尋求支援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......恐怕安全屋的那位幹員堅持不了這麼久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們繼續前往費坤，想辦法尋找支援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去長泉看看情況。這片地方老夫很熟悉，一個人行動也比較靈活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果情況太糟糕，我會去費坤與你們會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不贊同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沙地裡鑽出來的變異生物，安全屋的求救，說它們之間有聯繫可能顯得太過多疑，但我們必須在薩爾貢荒地裡保持警惕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_166",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在不清楚長泉鎮周圍情況的前提下，巡林者老先生您一個人去就更是太冒險了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_156_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也建議整隊一起行動，狀況不對我們也可以互相照應，掩護彼此撤離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們說的有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerId": "char_503_rang",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次老夫還是聽你們的。我這一把年紀，確實也不該像年輕時那樣孤身犯險了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這東西真是奇醜無比。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醜陋是基於個人審美的主觀感想，你應當看到這種生物的象徵意義，看到它在進化中展現出的無數種可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "秩序不過是我們強加給自然的虛構概念，世間萬物原本就是混沌無常的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（俄語）當然，我並不期待你這樣的人能明白這一點，你那愚蠢的腦袋自然理解不了生物進化的偉大之處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說我聽得懂的語言！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，先生。先不論你眼中的它醜陋與否，你看起來對結果都不是很滿意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然，你就不會現在來找我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是不夠強，學者！你的怪物甚至沒能讓領主衛隊分心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道不是因為你愚蠢的雇傭兵實在是太過無能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些變異的生物只是武器，如果它們懂得戰術，你的雇傭兵就可以被丟到垃圾堆裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放屁，老東西！我要把你的頭擰下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（扶額）唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽著，學者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我支持你的研究不是為了聽你在這裡大放厥詞，你需要為我解決實際問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我承認你的研究確實有過人之處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是！如果你不能幫我擊敗我的父親，那你和你的這些怪物才是毫無用處的廢物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的耐心是有限的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的耐心也是有限的，這個問題我已經給你解釋了很多次，我不想再浪費時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在糊弄我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這半年來，我已經在你的“實驗”中投入了你這輩子都沒見過的金額。但是我根本沒有得到等價的回報！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你承諾的“殘忍且可怕的軍隊”呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你承諾的“令人膽寒的力量”呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就拿幾個會發光的，醜陋腫脹的變種生物來敷衍我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要怎麼才能讓你明白？科研的果實需要時間來孕育。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果科學的進步只靠金錢就能催熟，那我早就該飛到月亮上去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠了，我再給你兩天時間，我要看到我想要的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（俄語）智障。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你再敢用我聽不懂的語言講話，我就把你丟到荒地上去，讓你和你的造物玩得開心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以試試看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（歎氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給我弄幾具屍體來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帶屍體來！人的屍體，你們這種生物的屍體！誰的都行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，那種感染了源石疾病的人更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個混帳老東西，你想侮辱死者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是想要“令人膽寒的力量”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就不要顧忌那種屁用都沒有的“倫理”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把屍體帶過來，我讓你看一點有趣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老大，這可有悖巴耶勒王酋的大戒律啊，這老東西是要坑你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這是要給我弄出一支長生軍來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道長生軍是什麼鬼東西，但是你可以對我的科研成果再抱一些信心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老大，我覺得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老傢伙，你聽好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可能覺得自己聰明絕頂，覺得自己深謀遠慮，覺得自己無所不知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是別想和我耍花招，你這樣的人我見識得太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這種人，只會死於自作聰明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我對你的容忍僅僅是因為你現在還有用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以給你需要的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是別讓我失望，你不會願意承擔讓我失望的後果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我還能說什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祝你好運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別忘了，是誰讓你活下去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果沒有我，你的研究根本就是一團畜糞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是我，半年前你就爛在這個礦洞裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（薩爾貢語）混帳東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德魯奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們兩個留在這裡繼續看著他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傭兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，頭兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（俄語）一群智障，和你們講話的每一秒都是對我寶貴腦細胞的謀殺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lab"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（俄語）源石......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（俄語）這個世界上竟然還有如此偉大的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（俄語）這些愚昧的本地人居然畏懼這種力量帶來的進化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（俄語）但是，噢，當然，他們也應當畏懼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（俄語）愚者畏懼未知，愚者畏懼力量，愚者畏懼進步......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列維",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（俄語）愚蠢啊，愚蠢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
